{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "3c7ad7b1a5859aa48dfd5668b979898e59cc2f89dbc3fcf333907746a89f3fbf", "ja": "おかしなおねーさん！？", "zh": "奇怪的大姊姊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "83a6d17fc2c4a2a1f87ed1029a949dc3d04d6d59865398a36d4e4cda0ff8ded1", "ja": "番組ロケのため待ち合わせをするアイドル達\nのもとに、オフのはずの雪歩がやってくる。\n番組に感動したため収録を見学したいとの\nことだが、どこか様子がおかしい。雪歩の\n強い希望を受け、一行はロケへと向かう。", "zh": "偶像们为了出外景录节目而集合，此时应该在\n休假的雪步来到她们身边。雪步说她看节目后\n很感动，所以想来录影现场观摩，但她看起来\n有些不寻常。一行人接受了雪步的强烈请求，\n一同前往外景地点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ce4024b0e012c2724654f0aebaa9ee18893744c0347aa3300bbfb6f35bf9e3f", "ja": "（今日は『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の野外ロケの日。\nひなたと星梨花は早速集合しているな）", "zh": "（今天是《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》拍外景的日子。\n日向和星梨花很早就来集合了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "69b801d9637d37a7c46982d91b47c9643f70fc3b4a73245c3e23db17ebaeab80", "ja": "『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』、クラスのみんなも\n「見てるよ」って言ってくれてます！", "zh": "我班上的同学也说他们有在看\n《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ca5494228004a4d53094a4a1673b5ac3fb6ad8aedbce863fa9cde08dd666668d", "ja": "ああ、子ども向け番組だけど、口コミで広まって\n大人にも観てもらえてるみたいだぞ！", "zh": "是啊，虽然这是儿童节目，但因为大家都在讨论，\n现在好像连大人也会收看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "59b9adea07d1c6bf9fa91f6513255895ab150cee0b3c093da7e05dc71bad51e0", "ja": "したっけ、今日の収録もがんばらねばね。\nね、星梨花ちゃん！", "zh": "既然如此，那我们今天也要努力录节目才行呢。\n你说对吧，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "61e03d99515d86882714b5e1135adf1b351dac146123f0cbe88b6ba4ad6210ea", "ja": "はい！　今日もジュニオールと一緒に、\nがんばります！", "zh": "是啊！我今天也会和朱尼奥尔\n一起加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1005_junior", "source_sha256": "519f4fc6f661f136896f78a2802108cb2bbe43b1c00f887a9ae8a6eeceb3537c", "ja": "ワン！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6b964b26025f51eed22f11d4d7d2f59e82a07ce813693484e2f3c926b859eb3b", "ja": "はは、ふたりと一匹は、気合たっぷりだな！\nあとは環と杏奈が来るのを待つばかり……あれ？", "zh": "哈哈，你们两位跟一只，还真充满了干劲呢！\n接下来就只要等环和杏奈来就好……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ad3ce49ce0f36da9d9a0c07aa7bb0aebc768be9794cd0e2c5d3d3f85eaa2a534", "ja": "確か、この辺りのはず……。", "zh": "我记得应该是在这附近没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0150c22af64b0599f52fef5e4f52b445804b5649b6eea26ade133352e386fc25", "ja": "ん？　あれは雪歩……だよな？", "zh": "嗯？那个人……不是雪步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a27b6bd1749f87395bedb2373410818d86d7739e53b542e86505409c7b796f7d", "ja": "雪歩、どうしたんだ？\n今日はオフじゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "雪步，你怎么了？\n我记得你今天不是休假吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c9f5c31d4d6d8407fc26a69ca6ce3cda623653cf8f1d5c16d3f34c61cfd6702", "ja": "セリカちゃん、ヒナタちゃん。\nそれに{$P$}……。", "zh": "星梨花、日向，\n还有{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f10ffd08b479b30136b0cf839cc732cf5710cfae160a1b7b682e12693c20e55b", "ja": "こんにちは。\nこんなところで会うなんて、奇遇ですね。", "zh": "你们好。\n没想到会在这里遇到你们，真巧呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d8ac8677ed348337da48a419f4193d1a056268d6ad82d21706294d6949e6a23c", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだな。俺達はこれから\n『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の収録なんだ。", "zh": "呃、嗯，是啊。\n我们等一下是要去拍《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9faf832a33f7b86ccf9db24fc3e30e2e5afb2464fc71c73d1b65c7831d4fe972", "ja": "はい、知ってますよ。\nそれで来たんです。", "zh": "是的，这我知道。\n所以我才会特地来这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1b6550d02c69cb9baeb705b9d049f7cb44892534fd24ef2a2df9e42b5a17cb41", "ja": "来たって……なんでまた？", "zh": "你说你特地来这里……是为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cec447530defd310bf69ca50217a0f45f04ce6146357dc2ee83aae248c8973b2", "ja": "みんながテレビで頑張ってるのを見て、調査研究……\nいえ、勉強しなきゃって。", "zh": "我在电视上看到大家很努力，就想来调查研究……\n不对，我是想要来学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6b6ccbba0fa6de60e505c29f982db2c5945714d4b70b82268a2186a6517baed1", "ja": "そうです。『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』です。\nこの番組を見て、とっても感動したんです。", "zh": "没错，我就是在说《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》。\n我在看了这个节目后，深深受到感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "a5eb683c9907638f605f282b027d808497747c989323366ab3787ccfcb4d1a71", "ja": "雪歩さんも見てくれてたんだぁ。ありがとねぇ。", "zh": "雪步你也有在看哪～太感谢了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4c71bb0a58a4eb4ef65fc67f57649a73ec3930db3ace51fa8eaf9ea1295ee392", "ja": "でも、感動って……？\nええと、どのへんがよかったんだ？", "zh": "不过你说感动……？\n呃，你是喜欢哪个部份啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "38efe3f0afdc03f2e0864cdabf12cefa508b88996ca9c2b765169471a37518bb", "ja": "地球にもこんな宇宙人がいて、世界を征服しようと\nしてるんだって……心打たれました。", "zh": "没想到地球上也有这样的外星人，\n居然打算征服世界……这非常打动我的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c4e57c2d38df70112a63a1ab197817587648f73846362430ef176731352a93a1", "ja": "ぜひ、今後の征服の参考にさせてください。", "zh": "请你们务必成为我今后征服时的参考对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0f3456548ee4671c6545bbf40fc2a61a082be08f3b59514629e0b2eebee96839", "ja": "（今後の……なんだって？）", "zh": "（今后的……她说什么？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "ade0fbdec89119c255c257084b4ce04066af566a1a00d8ee969d242b697bb45b", "ja": "ええと……つまり、アイドルとして、\n世界まで『せーふく』しちゃおうってことですか？", "zh": "呃……你的意思是想要作为偶像，\n『征服』全世界吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "19bb5c041837c01707a0f8dcf74ab72df8d44b57d047502d82b0b6da6bb21f14", "ja": "雪歩さん、さすがだねぇ。\n言うことが大きいべさ。", "zh": "真不愧是雪步呢～\n话题的规模好庞大哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5ca3f33de94d3f2a68a45953f66feaca10f4351e24af4a49c07b69a2aec5923e", "ja": "はい。\n宇宙の仲間として、みなさんに共感したんです。", "zh": "是啊。\n同样身为宇宙的伙伴，我和各位深有同感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "53ce9a405ae5d8a7c08bbcd224b43f2c034f06a89a8251e14eb05e4645094b82", "ja": "それって、あたし達が宇宙人っぽいってことかい？\nえへへ、うまく演じられてたってことかなぁ。", "zh": "你的意思是我们很有外星人的感觉吗？\n嘿嘿，那就代表我们演得很好吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "11928dbe6e4c307832db214f1946a364ebf6e0f92c93b29a102a7b6a7c20e32e", "ja": "わぁ、うれしいです！\nありがとうございます、雪歩さん♪", "zh": "哇，好高兴喔！\n谢谢你，雪步♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e07f37bf7706f8f1383abc6207374d7056a001d4fb028ae0023fa96b8fc1c898", "ja": "それで、是非『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の撮影を\n監視……観測……見学しなきゃって。", "zh": "所以说，我才想说必须来监视……观测……观摩\n《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》的拍摄现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b8cb7e18103139c2074252c165f32a26b3500efb9e374168942b7be67afecff1", "ja": "え、見学に来たのか？　勉強熱心なのはいいけど、\nずいぶん突然なんだな……。", "zh": "咦，你是来观摩的吗？虽然热衷学习是好事，\n但还真突然呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1029_junior", "source_sha256": "4af25773919c478abc9a8e2cc33850f6c877217e5977852c2d5ac1241b2f0ef9", "ja": "ワウワウ！　ワウ！", "zh": "汪汪！汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "7814672b54f76ab7bd6b3760f563be2d687c078d798450836b8319196cef0446", "ja": "ジュニオール？\n今は雪歩さんとお話してるから、静かにしてね。", "zh": "朱尼奥尔？\n我们在和雪步说话，你安静一下下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1031_junior", "source_sha256": "03fd05a8cf51d68d76c1f89e0dd966e4a05907d1abec8feee1f27734759f7a1d", "ja": "ワォーーン！", "zh": "汪呜──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "068531a6e3a7e5bb14a48358d9117af9aacdacdd91febf40ecbbaa5f2cf5b289", "ja": "ど、どうしたの、ジュニオール？\nえっと、クワイエット！", "zh": "怎、怎么啦，朱尼奥尔？\n呃，Quiet！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1033_junior", "source_sha256": "f3b34c31ad9972dbc3bb0c168e32f6c2ca895244018ada5eb0a5825438e2b1ec", "ja": "クーン……。", "zh": "汪呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "0cce00aaef7767b24622e8f29ce1d2fa0a22796cc73773bd14c17970892964a3", "ja": "（？　さっきから妙にジュニオールが\n落ち着かない様子だな……？）", "zh": "（怪了，朱尼奥尔怎么从刚才开始\n就一直坐立不安的样子……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f3ae4e1418ed889023e2c4a6a3abd40518082730fd506934d613810248bab963", "ja": "見学、ダメでしょうか……？", "zh": "我不能观摩吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "0b963ade336385d0a89a2836e0c8c34741e3977f3e030bf3c50d8ab42310f183", "ja": "まあ、見学なら大丈夫だとは思うけど……\nでも一応、スタッフの確認をとってみないと。", "zh": "嗯，只是观摩的话应该是没问题啦……\n不过还是得先问问看工作人员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3011f4c82f0f94b46d0aa7d5cf89e41edae43d320c12e0e7254b3bffe3debb09", "ja": "ぜひ、お願いしますぅ。", "zh": "那就麻烦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9f45da35359cb5b25e6ba2392d8a0e052e45d5ac33572cb60cb0758d59a3ab77", "ja": "わかった。\n雪歩がそこまで言うなら、頼んでみるよ。", "zh": "我知道了。\n既然雪步都这么说了，我就去拜托他们看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "4de727b0a83c3ae7dc99e6b9510d4e796a9129658a3ca4957eff50c1a23173b2", "ja": "お～い、おやぶ～ん！\n……あれ、雪歩お姉ちゃんがいる～！", "zh": "喂～老大～！\n……咦，雪步姊姊也在耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "37a2e5bfd1de7b5d8bf0efed691a11bbd41077ca29b453eeee3decfcb0efad8c", "ja": "雪歩、さん……。\nおはよ、ございます……。", "zh": "雪步……\n早安呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1041_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f620b0668a2ec991800aecfd84d9e9731b943e644259462743297d34ec85ebcb", "ja": "えっと……。あ、タマキちゃんとアンナちゃん。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "呃……啊，是小环和杏奈。\n你们早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "535da4310e794b11a411d8df03077178493a8058ec3aa5957edcd21a440cffd1", "ja": "……？　雪歩さん……\nジュニオール、怖くない、の……？", "zh": "嗯……？雪步……\n你不怕朱尼奥尔，吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "549565f26e3f0e8ff6516110931ed1d601d6f1886b12c41e9626fc8b862f2399", "ja": "コワクナイ……？", "zh": "不怕……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1044_junior", "source_sha256": "519f4fc6f661f136896f78a2802108cb2bbe43b1c00f887a9ae8a6eeceb3537c", "ja": "ワン！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c97495b6db01e5423e23b9fe9f5b3cda4b45e03ba78750958bc8fe918a2d7c1d", "ja": "あっ、そうでした！　ええと……。\nひう！　犬です！　穴掘って埋まってます～！", "zh": "啊，对耶！我想想……\n咿呜！是狗！我要挖洞把自己埋起来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "abb6e8f28f53932192ae247a142a9eed41ff1e03422b27ae6dcedae751cd6974", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい、雪歩さん！\nジュニオール、こっちに来て、ダウン。ね？", "zh": "对、对不起，雪步姊姊！\n朱尼奥尔，到这边来，Down，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1047_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d31fe29dabe8aa42973ae1fdbb67173ec7fd25401073181b68da07457b24bc04", "ja": "さ、さあ、早く行きましょう。\n収録に遅刻したら大変です。……大変ですぅ。", "zh": "好、好了，大家赶快走吧。\n要是录影迟到那就不好了……就不好了呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "23a9b755481c5a8e361b4a2398d59bc52d10dc48ccd9e9a06dbe05bfe9e8b0f8", "ja": "（なんだろう。うまく言えないけど、\n今日の雪歩は……なんか、おかしいぞ？）", "zh": "（怎么回事？我说不上来，\n但总觉得今天的雪步……有点怪怪的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
